{
  "$schema": "https://docs.renovatebot.com/renovate-schema.json",
  "extends": [
    "config:recommended",
    "mergeConfidence:all-badges"
],
"prBodyColumns": [
    "Package",
    "Change",
    "Age",
    "Confidence"
],
"platform": "github",
"autodiscover": true,
"autodiscoverFilter": [
    "MiguelPedraz/tasksapi"
  ],
"baseBranches": [
    "develop"
],
"gitAuthor": "Renovate Bot <bot@renovateapp.com>",
  "ignoreDeps": [],
"ignoreUnstable": true,
"respectLatest": true,
"enabledManagers": [
    "gradle",
    "gradle-wrapper",
    "github-actions"
],
"hostRules": [
    {
        "matchHost": "https://repo1.maven.org",
        "description": "Maven Central (Sonatype CDN) - Primary source for Maven dependencies"
    }
],
  "packageRules": [
    {
    "description": "Ignore non-stable versions globally (all managers)",
    "matchPackagePatterns": [
        ".*"
    ],
    "allowedVersions": "!/^.*(-alpha|-beta|-rc|-snapshot|-dev|-pre|-milestone|-m\\d+).*$/i"
},
{
    "description": "Auto-merge minor/patch updates for all Maven dependencies",
      "matchDatasources": ["maven"],
      "matchUpdateTypes": ["minor", "patch"],
      "automerge": true,
      "automergeType": "pr",
      "automergeStrategy": "squash"
    },
    {
    "description": "Group Spring Framework updates",
      "matchDatasources": ["maven"],
    "matchPackagePrefixes": [
        "org.springframework"
    ],
      "schedule": ["before 3am on Monday"],
    "groupName": "Spring Framework",
    "prBodyNotes": [
        "📦 **Spring Framework Dependencies Cross-Check:**",
        "",
        "### 🔗 Related Packages in `libs.versions.toml`:",
        "",
        "| Package | Role | Release Notes |",
        "|---------|------|---------------|",
        "| `org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-starter-parent` | BOM / Parent POM | [Releases](https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/releases) |",
        "| `io.spring.dependency-management` | Gradle plugin (version pinned separately) | [Releases](https://github.com/spring-gradle-plugins/dependency-management-plugin/releases) |",
        "",
        "⚠️ **Compatibility:** Verify Spring Boot BOM aligns with the new Spring Framework version.",
        "🔗 [Compatibility Matrix](https://spring.io/projects/spring-boot#support)"
    ]
},
{
    "description": "Testcontainers core - major updates require manual review (modules are versioned separately)",
    "matchDatasources": [
        "maven"
    ],
    "matchPackageNames": [
        "org.testcontainers:testcontainers"
    ],
    "matchUpdateTypes": [
        "major"
    ],
    "automerge": false,
    "stabilityDays": 3,
    "prPriority": 10,
    "prBodyNotes": [
        "⚠️ **Testcontainers Core — Major Update**",
        "",
        "This updates only `org.testcontainers:testcontainers` (version var `testcontainers` in `libs.versions.toml`).",
        "The dependent modules use a **separate** version variable `testcontainers-modules` and are NOT affected by this PR.",
        "",
        "### ✅ Merge Checklist:",
        "- [ ] Build passes in CI/CD",
        "- [ ] No dependency resolution errors in logs",
        "- [ ] [Release Notes](https://github.com/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/releases/tag/v{{{newVersion}}})"
    ]
},
{
    "description": "Testcontainers modules (junit-jupiter, postgresql) — block major: 2.x artifacts do not exist independently",
    "matchDatasources": [
        "maven"
    ],
    "matchPackageNames": [
        "org.testcontainers:junit-jupiter",
        "org.testcontainers:postgresql"
    ],
    "matchUpdateTypes": [
        "major"
    ],
    "enabled": false
},
{
    "description": "Testcontainers - Auto-merge minor/patch updates",
    "matchDatasources": [
        "maven"
    ],
    "matchPackageNames": [
        "org.testcontainers:testcontainers",
        "org.testcontainers:junit-jupiter",
        "org.testcontainers:postgresql"
    ],
    "matchUpdateTypes": [
        "minor",
        "patch"
    ],
    "automerge": true,
    "groupName": "Testcontainers",
    "groupSlug": "testcontainers",
    "prBodyNotes": [
        "📦 **Testcontainers Multi-Module Update**",
        "",
        "All three modules always release together on 1.x. They use two version variables in `libs.versions.toml`: `testcontainers` (core) and `testcontainers-modules` (junit-jupiter, postgresql).",
        "",
        "### 🔍 Verify all modules exist in Maven Central before merging:",
        "| Module | Current | Proposed | All versions (Maven Central) |\n|--------|---------|----------|------------------------------|\n| `org.testcontainers:testcontainers` | `{{{currentVersion}}}` | **{{{newVersion}}}** | [📦 All versions](https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.testcontainers/testcontainers/versions) |\n| `org.testcontainers:junit-jupiter` | `{{{currentVersion}}}` | **{{{newVersion}}}** | [📦 All versions](https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.testcontainers/junit-jupiter/versions) |\n| `org.testcontainers:postgresql` | `{{{currentVersion}}}` | **{{{newVersion}}}** | [📦 All versions](https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.testcontainers/postgresql/versions) |",
        "",
        "### ✅ Merge Checklist:",
        "- [ ] Version **{{{newVersion}}}** exists for ALL 3 modules in Maven Central (check links above)",
        "- [ ] Build passes in CI/CD",
        "- [ ] No dependency resolution errors in logs",
        "",
        "**⚠️ If ANY module is missing version {{{newVersion}}}, DO NOT MERGE — wait for a synchronized release.**"
    ]
},
{
    "description": "Group Testing frameworks with module dependency info",
      "matchDatasources": ["maven"],
    "matchPackageNames": [
        "org.junit.jupiter:junit-jupiter",
        "org.junit.platform:junit-platform-launcher",
        "org.mockito:mockito-core",
        "org.mockito:mockito-junit-jupiter",
        "io.rest-assured:rest-assured"
    ],
    "groupName": "Testing Dependencies",
    "prBodyNotes": [
        "🧪 **Testing Dependencies — Multi-Module Check**",
        "",
        "### 📦 Packages grouped by shared version variable in `libs.versions.toml`:",
        "",
        "| Package | Role | Version Variable | Release Notes |",
        "|---------|------|------------------|---------------|",
        "| `org.junit.jupiter:junit-jupiter` | JUnit 5 test framework | `junit-jupiter` | [Releases](https://github.com/junit-team/junit5/releases) |",
        "| `org.junit.platform:junit-platform-launcher` | JUnit Platform (BOM-managed) | `junit-jupiter` | [Releases](https://github.com/junit-team/junit5/releases) |",
        "| `org.mockito:mockito-core` | Mocking framework core | `mockito` | [Releases](https://github.com/mockito/mockito/releases) |",
        "| `org.mockito:mockito-junit-jupiter` | Mockito JUnit 5 integration | `mockito` | [Releases](https://github.com/mockito/mockito/releases) |",
        "| `io.rest-assured:rest-assured` | HTTP testing library | `rest-assured` | [Releases](https://github.com/rest-assured/rest-assured/wiki/ReleaseNotes) |",
        "",
        "⚠️ **Compatibility:** JUnit 6.x requires Java 21+",
        "🔗 [JUnit Docs](https://junit.org/junit5/docs/current/user-guide/) | [Mockito Docs](https://javadoc.io/doc/org.mockito/mockito-core/latest/)"
    ]
    },
    {
    "description": "Group Database drivers",
    "matchDatasources": [
        "maven"
    ],
    "matchPackagePrefixes": [
        "org.postgresql",
        "com.h2database"
    ],
    "groupName": "Database Drivers",
    "prBodyNotes": [
        "🗄️ **Database Dependencies — Multi-Driver Update**",
        "",
        "| Package | Change | Release Notes |",
        "|---------|--------|---------------|",
        "| `org.postgresql:postgresql` | {{{currentVersion}}} → **{{{newVersion}}}** | [Changelog](https://jdbc.postgresql.org/changelogs/) |",
        "| `com.h2database:h2` | {{{currentVersion}}} → **{{{newVersion}}}** | [Changelog](http://www.h2database.com/html/changelog.html) |",
        "",
        "### 🔗 Related Dependency (not updated here):",
        "",
        "| Package | Role | Verify |",
        "|---------|------|--------|",
        "| `org.testcontainers:postgresql` | Testcontainers PostgreSQL module | [Maven Central](https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.testcontainers/postgresql) |"
    ]
},
{
    "description": "Group Observability tools",
      "matchDatasources": ["maven"],
    "matchPackagePrefixes": [
        "io.micrometer",
        "org.springdoc"
    ],
    "groupName": "Observability & Documentation"
},
{
    "description": "Group Build tools and Gradle plugins",
    "matchManagers": [
        "gradle"
    ],
    "matchDepTypes": [
        "plugin"
    ],
    "groupName": "Build Tools & Plugins"
},
{
    "description": "Stable releases for GitHub Actions",
    "matchManagers": [
        "github-actions"
    ],
    "pinDigests": false,
    "semanticCommits": "enabled"
    }
  ],
  "labels": ["dependencies", "automated"],
"assignees": [
    "@MiguelPedraz"
],
  "schedule": ["after 10pm every weekday", "before 5am every weekday"],
  "timezone": "Europe/Madrid",
  "prConcurrentLimit": 5,
  "prCreation": "immediate",
"rebaseWhen": "behind-base-branch",
  "lockFileMaintenance": {
    "enabled": true,
    "schedule": ["before 3am on Monday"]
  }
}
